flowchart LR
    User[User]
    Win[Windows Security Authority\nSID / Logon Session / OS Trust]

    subgraph Session[Interactive User Session]
      Manager[SplitOS Manager]
      Launcher[Game Launcher]
      Runtime[SplitOS Runtime Host]
      Adapters[Game Client Adapters]
    end

    subgraph Privileged[Privileged Zone]
      Broker[SplitOS Privileged Broker\nWindows Service]
    end

    subgraph LocalState[Local Persistent State]
      Assoc[Account Association]
      Secrets[Protected Account Secrets]
      EntCache[Offline Entitlement Evidence]
      Tx[Mode / Update / Recovery Transactions]
      Profiles[Game Profiles]
    end

    subgraph Backend[SplitOS Backend Trust Domain]
      Auth[Account / Authorization]
      Ent[Entitlement Authority]
      ReleaseMeta[Release Metadata Distribution]
    end

    subgraph Release[Release / Build Trust Domain]
      Signing[Release Signing Authority\nPrivate keys stay here]
      Manifest[Signed Build / Update Manifest]
      Packages[Signed / Digest-bound Packages]
    end

    subgraph External[External Authorities]
      Payment[Payment Provider]
      Clients[Steam / Epic / Xbox / Battle.net]
      MS[Microsoft Windows Source / Updates]
      Devices[Windows Drivers / Devices]
    end

    User --> Manager
    User --> Launcher
    Win --> Runtime
    Manager --> Runtime
    Launcher --> Runtime

    Runtime -->|authenticated + authorized IPC\nexplicit ACL / caller validation| Broker
    Win -->|token / session evidence| Broker

    Runtime --> Assoc
    Runtime --> Secrets
    Runtime --> EntCache
    Runtime --> Tx
    Runtime --> Profiles

    Runtime -->|HTTPS + account token| Auth
    Auth --> Ent
    Ent -->|server / bounded offline evidence| Runtime

    Manager -->|hosted checkout start| Auth
    Auth --> Payment
    Payment -->|authenticated payment evidence| Auth
    Auth --> Ent

    Adapters -->|bounded parsing / normalization| Clients
    Clients -->|install / auth / launch evidence| Adapters
    Adapters --> Runtime

    Devices -->|actual state evidence| Runtime

    Signing --> Manifest
    Signing --> Packages
    Manifest --> ReleaseMeta
    Packages --> ReleaseMeta
    ReleaseMeta -->|signed metadata + exact artifact binding| Runtime
    MS -->|validated external source/update input| Runtime

    Manifest -->|validated Build input| Runtime
    Packages -->|verified artifact ref| Broker

